WEBVTT

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.211
It will get here, there's no question.

00:05:04.353 --> 00:05:06.432
And the important thing to remember

00:05:06.456 --> 00:05:09.627
is that this simulation is a good one.

00:05:10.162 --> 00:05:12.716
It's believable, it's tactile.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.621
You can reach out -- things are solid.

00:05:14.645 --> 00:05:17.134
You can move objects
from one area to another.

00:05:17.866 --> 00:05:19.404
You can feel your body.

00:05:19.428 --> 00:05:21.882
You can say, "I'd like to go over
to this location,"

00:05:21.906 --> 00:05:25.117
and you can move this mass
of molecules through the air

00:05:25.141 --> 00:05:27.087
over to another location, at will.

00:05:27.431 --> 00:05:30.577
(Laughter)